  "notes": "Adam and Hawwa are never drawn. Light for «تغفر لنا وترحمنا», an hourglass for «ومتاع إلى حين». Al-Muyassar's bracketed note quoting 2:37 not used. STAGING v4: Staging v4: kept ambient, as for the same words in Al-Baqara (2:36-37). 23 is the du'a of Adam and his wife after the call in the Garden; 24 is the command to descend, addressed to Adam, his wife and Iblis (Al-Muyassar). The plate on 23:7 (asking His forgiveness) is now geometric instead of light, as a light plate must not start on His act. Adam's wife and Iblis are never drawn; drawing Adam alone at the descent would suggest he descended alone, so he is not drawn either."
